{
  "name": "@dzhechkov/skills-decision-mockups",
  "version": "0.1.6",
  "description": "decision-mockups — build an owner-facing decision page: plain-language explanations, browser-frame before/after mockups, clickable option forks and a copy-answers export that pastes back into the session. Ships a zero-dependency deterministic gate (G0-G14) that blocks publication of a page with a fake fork, an untokenised colour, an external resource, a hand-written counter or a leftover placeholder.",
